The GSSTI has four key objectives:

1. To develop Ghana's space science and technology infrastructure to progress the country's space science and technology capabilities;
2. To promote and encourage the application of space science and technology to generate new sources of income and wealth;
3. To promote and encourage the development of entrepreneurship in space science and technology; and
4. To promote and encourage the development of innovative space science and technology solutions to socio-economic development matters.

